    "detail": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1、公司主营</span></p>\n<p>公司长期稳定从事黄金、锑和钨金属的矿山开采，选矿及冶炼加工等业务。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/2101_20220921160251_ddaa507d247ff0db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"315\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2、公司拥有矿端资源，尽享成本优势</span></p>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\">公司拥有和控制矿业权40个，其中探矿权25个、采矿权15个，探矿权面积299.34平方公里、采矿权面积48.4137平方公里。<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">其中锑金属储量约占国内总储量的60%。&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/2102_20220921160540_cee54518470ad5c0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"871\" height=\"228\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3、锑：光伏金属，新的五年</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\">锑广泛应用于阻燃剂、蓄电池及金属合金、化学制品等领域，其中阻燃材料是主要部分，需求量占比55%左右，其次是铅酸电池，需求量占比15%左右，聚酯催化占比15%左右，玻璃陶瓷占比10%左右。此外，光伏领域将成为锑需求新的增长点。光伏领域需求占比将从7.30%&rarr;21.33%。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"175.03199999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/2103_20220921160813_1c4834529be2dae3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"911\" height=\"311\" /></div>",
